<body style="height: auto; min-height: auto;">
<p style="line-height:1.38"><span style="font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">Hi {{{Recipient.FirstName}}},</span></span></span></span></span></span><br />
&nbsp;</p>

<p style="line-height:1.38"><span style="font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">With so many customers searching for insurance online, digital marketing is more important than ever before. <em><strong>That’s why we’re absolutely thrilled to announce the launch of our new digital Marketing Services product – exclusively for Farmers agents!</strong></em></span></span></span></span></span></span><br />
&nbsp;</p>

<p style="line-height:1.38"><span style="font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">By adding in our EverQuote Marketing Services - you’ll be able to leverage our deep expertise in growth marketing, data and analytics and work with a single partner for leads, consumer-initiated inbound calls, PLUS digital marketing. A one stop shop for growing your agency!The overview:</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>

<ul>
	<li aria-level="1" style="list-style-type:disc"><span style="font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">The monthly subscription fee is $250 which is Cost-share eligible at 50%</span></span></span></span></span></span></li>
	<li aria-level="1" style="list-style-type:disc"><span style="font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">You can set your monthly ad spend budget (also cost-share eligible at 50%) based on your desired amount of qualified consumers per month (minimum spend required)</span></span></span></span></span></span></li>
	<li aria-level="1" style="list-style-type:disc"><span style="font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">Monthly data reviews with your Business Consultant to analyze and refine your campaign performance</span></span></span></span></span></span></li>
</ul>

<p style="line-height:1.38"><br />
<span style="font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none"><em><strong>Spots are limited</strong></em> so if you’re interested in joining or learning more, let me know and I can reserve you a spot!</span></span></span></span></span></span><br />
&nbsp;</p>

<p><span style="font-size:14px;"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">Give me a call at {{{Sender.Phone}}} or let’s schedule some time to connect: {{{Sender.Salesforce_Meeting_Link__c}}}.</span></span></p>

<p style="line-height:1.38">&nbsp;</p>

